{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本武道館！無事4日間終了しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったって！もう楽しくて楽しくて！そして...\nそして感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花とかも沢山有難う御座いました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさんが撮ってくれたのをちょっと載せるね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回【君は僕と会わない方が良かったのかな】\nのセンターをやりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソロパートもあって緊張したけど自分の精一杯の歌を届けれることができたと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして制服のマネキンでは\n中田、川村、樋口、和田の4人でバキバキに踊りました^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやマネージャーが\n乃木坂のダンス選抜だ！！！っていってくれて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り付けをサビ以外全部激しいダンスに変えて披露しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりダンス好きだなぁと確信しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんも舞台頑張ってるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんは卒業を発表して\n新しい道に向かって行ってるし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直めっちゃメチャクチャ寂しくて...本当はもっともっといっしょにいたかったよ...沢山の想いがいっぱいある...大切な存在...これからもずっと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ卒業日は決まってないけど残りの時間！\n最高に思いで作ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな頑張ってます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてライブスカパー生中継見てくれましたか？武道館に来てくださった方とかは知ってると思いますが\nクリスマスメドレーの一番最初の言葉！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"英語スピーチ努めさせて頂きました！\nあれはメンバーみんながまあやが学校でリハにいない時に\nここのところをまあやにやらせてあげたいって言ってくれたんだって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかそれ聞いてほんとみんないいおねぇちゃんばっかで心がほっこりしましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！英語で思い出した！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レギュラー番組のぎえいごのクリスマスSP見てくださいましたか！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2011年から始まった乃木坂メンバーとしての活動せいらりんは同じ１期生で地方組で、沢山の思い出がある..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う～ん...やっぱりまだ書かない！てか書けない！..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ応援ありがとうございました！\n武道館に来てくれた方！\n（≧∇≦）ありがとうございました！\nこれないけど応援してくれた方\n応援ありがとうございました（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も後少しです。\n精一杯走っていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会も楽しみ（≧∇≦）\n完売が増えたよ！ってコメント見た～\n本当に嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな服を着ようかな～\nお友達のママが お洋服をプレゼントしてくれたからそれを着ようかな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスはみんなサンタさんに何をお願いする？？\n今年いい子にしてたからきっとまあやのところにもサンタさん来てくれるとまあや信じております..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もみんながhappyでありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/22/8743886/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}